1 Introduction

1.1    Background and Restatement




                                                                       型
      With the development of technology, transportation between countries has become
more and more convenient, so trade has become more frequent. At the same time, in




                                                         模
some areas, there is a growing demand for wildlife for a variety of purposes, such as
leather, jewelry, or medicine. To protect the environment and global biodiversity, some




                                                        学
countries have reached a number of wildlife protection conventions, that is, prohibit the
trade of some endangered wild animals.




                                                   数
      However, these regulations only make a principled provision, which cannot decline
illegal wildlife trade(IWT) effectively, and there are still many people hunting, smuggling,

                                    ：
and selling endangered wildlife for profit. Therefore, an appropriate project designed to




                                                            els
make a notable reduction in IWT needs to be carried out by a client with power, resource,
                                   号
and interest. Then the topics to be discussed are: who is the client? What can the client




                                                          od
realistically do? Why the project is suitable for the client? How to convince the client?
                           众

What additional powers and resources will the client need to carry out the project? What
                                                         m
will happen if the project is carried out? How likely is the project to reach the expected
                    公


                                              H
goal? Therefore, a reasonable solution is needed to quantify and compare the investment
of the client and the benefits from the project.
                                           AT
       信
      微




