2.2    Assumptions and Justification

      To simplify the problem, we made the following assumptions, each of which has
a corresponding reasonable explanation. Additional assumptions are made to simplify
analysis for individual sections later.




                                                                        型
   • The data we collected online is accurate and reliable because our data all come from




                                                          模
       official websites of international organizations, it’s reasonable to assume high qual-
       ity of our data.




                                                         学
   • All individuals our project considered are rational, meaning that they do things
       maximizing their net revenue(the revenue minus the cost). It’s always a basic as-




                                                  数
       sumption in economics.
   • Our client has sufficient powers and resources to carry out our polices in full, with-

                                    ：
       out any omissions. Any additional power or resource is not needed. It’s reasonable




                                                             els
       because the government of the United Republic of Tanzania leads the country and
                                   号
       has the most executive power.




